{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","permalink_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/OmniNode-ai:116b491...OmniNode-ai:116b491","diff_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/compare/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466...116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","node_id":"C_kwDOPuAjtNoAKDExNmI0OTE0M2VhY2Q2NWVkOTVjMGVlYjdiYjlkYzQ4MzQ1OGQ0NjY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Jonah Gray","email":"jonah@omninode.ai","date":"2026-09-06T17:40:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-06T17:40:32Z"},"message":"fix(OMN-17996): move the pre-push placement columns to a private overlay (#3246)\n\nThe lab host table published, in one public file, three RFC1918 addresses, a\ntailnet MagicDNS name embedding the tailnet identifier, six absolute home\npaths, and -- in the cloud row -- an EC2 instance id, its type, its\navailability zone and the statement that it holds a routable Elastic IP.\n\nSplit by AUTHORITY, not by file. ssh_target, uv_abs_path and workroot are\nplacement data and now read the `@private` token, hydrated at read time from\n$OMNI_HOME/config/lab/prepush_hosts.omnibase_infra.overlay.tsv in the private\nworkspace repository. The identity columns (label, role, hostname, mode) stay\nin this committed file, still read with `git show HEAD:`, still refusing on\nworking-tree divergence, and still re-checked on the remote host by\npytest_full_suite_host_guard.py. The OMN-16688 no-file-on-disk-to-forge premise\nis untouched, because the half that moved was never the authorizing half --\nwhich is also why the overlay needs no digest pin.\n\nThe identity half CANNOT move, mechanically: the remote leg is bundle -> scp ->\nclone, so the lab host evaluates identity against a clone of this file, and\nremoving it drops four of six rows to the two code-embedded default hostnames\nand refuses every heavy remote leg on them.\n\nAbsence is a SKIP: unset OMNI_HOME or a missing overlay leaves the columns\nunresolved, the row unplaceable, and lab placement skipped. It never refuses a\npush.","tree":{"sha":"58f4953e11440486e150652754cfb304d18893cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/trees/58f4953e11440486e150652754cfb304d18893cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/git/commits/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnaWQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQ/IQAFjFJ1C3AcELJwmJZ/VdF+Ze\nKg3xo2w7PFNLuRpFSKtu/dDpv4AIHPG4z5T7ycA097lwhZYygthVyLUL4scnNg0m\nQCbJJq5ftjehnbm/zi34Pqpi0ULFtspvYaJ5LeCSNb8j6j7RPMHYsKhAQ7hKHGuf\nty/R/aHkRrTr3KPTgB2BBA4jyfPJ+uuPJX8Uu2gEVmbnQWNf9RAQnsKSJb4m6Q8N\nuzU/BAPy+z7e5Z2LiLU+ucMIvklK47MXYnifXsAxqW2TH1D0Gkaxs1pFqEjw5b0u\nMcA/eZJE3RN9Iw9L+QYoxjcfxj2lduWKOKlTkfgOBQGGYSAMy0tMRJIRjHmfnYz9\n2ZJEoC6OCF1FQgDwDjxoxM5+3yRwCYJqGJnJpRKSFOQVbuft/kPiVfy/Tb31q8y+\nHrsVxrkb9EiuLNZeCVL6lu4wMcoz2NoFUaucYq8Wee/nLHwCslUikSG80eWWn725\nqwpfoP7N0F/trlXRqdvIX7GT4Fgxik78O2wbmDmHbKgTT2cs4r+lDAmO3sZEWLpW\n2pYGRmUh8VeEFHNA77yX0/jqiSQyjsXas9h6qPUnKVVfRKoWOLEZZXzeJGfBDPqz\npnsNl+tk2WckmHzRm2sDZgTeQKGVvzv3nYDekGs3WO05heLoz2MIWDQAqHQxZIlp\nKU/6ZQLtcJ+kDj0CZLew\n=8Wr1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 58f4953e11440486e150652754cfb304d18893cd\nparent 82be2ec1a2fd1e8e7a0293d8dd9b87b33288b051\nauthor Jonah Gray <jonah@omninode.ai> 1788716432 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788716432 +0000\n\nfix(OMN-17996): move the pre-push placement columns to a private overlay (#3246)\n\nThe lab host table published, in one public file, three RFC1918 addresses, a\ntailnet MagicDNS name embedding the tailnet identifier, six absolute home\npaths, and -- in the cloud row -- an EC2 instance id, its type, its\navailability zone and the statement that it holds a routable Elastic IP.\n\nSplit by AUTHORITY, not by file. ssh_target, uv_abs_path and workroot are\nplacement data and now read the `@private` token, hydrated at read time from\n$OMNI_HOME/config/lab/prepush_hosts.omnibase_infra.overlay.tsv in the private\nworkspace repository. The identity columns (label, role, hostname, mode) stay\nin this committed file, still read with `git show HEAD:`, still refusing on\nworking-tree divergence, and still re-checked on the remote host by\npytest_full_suite_host_guard.py. The OMN-16688 no-file-on-disk-to-forge premise\nis untouched, because the half that moved was never the authorizing half --\nwhich is also why the overlay needs no digest pin.\n\nThe identity half CANNOT move, mechanically: the remote leg is bundle -> scp ->\nclone, so the lab host evaluates identity against a clone of this file, and\nremoving it drops four of six rows to the two code-embedded default hostnames\nand refuses every heavy remote leg on them.\n\nAbsence is a SKIP: unset OMNI_HOME or a missing overlay leaves the columns\nunresolved, the row unplaceable, and lab placement skipped. It never refuses a\npush.","verified_at":"2026-09-06T17:40:33Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","html_url":"https://github.com/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commit/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnibase_infra/commits/116b49143eacd65ed95c0eeb7bb9dc483458d466/comments","author":{"login":"jonahgabriel","id":1002253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDIyNTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont